    "body": "Occurrence 2: run 43587095462 on main `1bd9298d6b1b5bb2858de6388f9b4d2691023249` (post-merge gate batch, 2026-11-14). Test `a_lowered_cap_refuses_the_same_face_at_once` failed at the 30 s cap with \"import did not finish within 30s\"; the binary ran 35.61 s. Same family as the occurrence on `7c07e8683`. Your fix merged at `141bc0696` (PR #1652): the default-cap test now runs in its own binary and the capped pins carry the 120 s barrier. The red on that run's other suite is a real regression, filed as #1657.\n",
